        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository dda2781b-ff82-482a-bf5c-bb5cedf9dd28).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\r\ryour todays L&apos;Aperitif  journey will take you to an exclusive trip to explore the world of rain, stairs, homeless people and scrappy dumplings. After taking some deep breaths you feel the rain on your skin and start your route, but open your eyes widely - there are some really annoying and nosy NPC&apos;s.\r\rHave fun and make some noise, but please after you finished your contract. The agency trusts you!\r\rCheeeers,\r\rBuuurgers",
